DirectInput8Create     DirectInput8Create                 since 1  status implemented entry point; returns IDirectInput8A; version below 0x0800 is refused
IDirectInput8A         AddRef/Release                     since 1  status implemented reference counts of the COM objects are the facade's; a device lives while the table holds it
IDirectInput8A         CreateDevice                       since 1  status implemented keyboard, mouse and one game controller per GUID
IDirectInput8A         EnumDevices                        since 1  status implemented callback runs a guest function (facade)
IDirectInput8A         EnumDevicesBySemantics             since 1  status partial   keyboard and mouse genres are listed; game-controller genres are not mapped (no table in the library)
IDirectInput8A         ConfigureDevices                   since 1  status stub      needs a UI: fails with DIERR_UNSUPPORTED (not logged); the game was not seen calling it
IDirectInputDevice8A   AddRef/Release                     since 1  status implemented 
IDirectInputDevice8A   Acquire/Unacquire                  since 1  status implemented 
