IDirectInputDevice8A   GetDeviceData                      since 1  status implemented buffered events; overflow reporting
IDirectInputDevice8A   SetDataFormat                      since 1  status implemented 
IDirectInputDevice8A   SetCooperativeLevel                since 1  status implemented 
IDirectInputDevice8A   SetProperty/GetProperty            since 1  status implemented buffer size, axis range, dead zone
IDirectInputDevice8A   Poll                               since 1  status implemented 
